      <h1 class="page-title">Continuous Modernization for the AI Era</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base text-ink/70">Modernization is no longer a one-time project — it is an ongoing discipline. Organizations that continuously modernize with AI can innovate faster while reducing cost, technical debt, and risk.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section reveal">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 lg:px-6">
      <div class="prose-content">
        <p>The traditional model of modernization — a large, multi-year migration project that ends with a go-live celebration — is obsolete. Technology estates evolve too quickly, business requirements change too frequently, and the pace of AI advancement makes point-in-time transformations obsolete before they are complete. Organisations that treat modernization as a discrete project will find themselves starting over every few years.</p>
        <p>Continuous modernization replaces the project model with an ongoing discipline. Legacy systems evolve incrementally rather than being replaced wholesale. Modernization and operations happen simultaneously, not sequentially. AI accelerates every stage — from assessment and planning through migration, testing, and optimisation.</p>

        <h2>What This Means for You</h2>
        <ul class="checklist">
          <li>Legacy systems must evolve, not just be replaced — wrapping, refactoring, and integrating existing systems is often more effective than wholesale replacement</li>
          <li>Modernization and operations happen simultaneously — the team that operates the system is best positioned to modernise it, because they understand its real-world behaviour</li>
          <li>AI accelerates every stage of the modernization journey — from automated code analysis and migration to testing, validation, and ongoing optimisation</li>
          <li>Measurable business outcomes drive prioritization — modernisation decisions are justified by business value, not technical purity</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Our Approach</h2>
        <p>We enable continuous modernization through:</p>
        <ul class="checklist">
          <li>AI-enabled assessment and planning tools that map application estates, dependencies, and modernisation pathways faster than manual analysis</li>
          <li>Automated migration and refactoring capabilities that reduce the time and risk of moving workloads to modern platforms</li>
          <li>Integrated operations and modernization workflows — the same teams that manage your systems also identify and execute modernisation opportunities</li>
          <li>Outcome tracking and optimisation that measures the business impact of each modernisation step and informs the next priority</li>
        </ul>

        <blockquote>Modernization done well is invisible — it happens continuously, in small increments, guided by business outcomes, and accelerated by AI. The organisations that master this discipline will compound their advantage over time.</blockquote>
      </div>
